                         Frank Berni - Cognizant
  Description          : VF custom template page for the Price Quote Summary section for CPQ Quote generation
  
  Modifications Log
  <Date>       <Author>            <Modification>    
  10/01/2024   Brent Mac           Initial creation
  10/29/2024   Frank Berni         W-016384: New Discount columns, formatted percent and currency fields, Dynamically rendered columns and column width sizes.
  10/30/2024   Frank Berni         W-016384: Adjusted Discount % so it displays with 2 decimal places
  10/31/2024   Frank Berni         W-016384: Removed all borders except for top and bottom border for header row
  11/04/2024   Frank Berni         W-016384: Reverted back to borders on all rows
  11/05/2024   Frank Berni         W-016384: Added a new row for the SUM variables for Base, Free and Total Amount fields 
  11/05/2024   Frank Berni         Updated Total columns to use Paid Amt field instead 
  11/25/2024   Frank Berni         Switched BaseAmount__c to PromoBaseAmount__c
  *********************************************************
